# CODEOWNERS: who is asked to review changes to each folder.
# GitHub requests a review from the owners automatically when a pull request changes their files.
# With the branch rule "Require review from Code Owners", ONE of the listed owners must approve.
#
# 1. Replace the example usernames with your squad's (keep the @).
# 2. Remove the "# " at the start of each rule line.
# 3. Every owner needs write access to the repository, or GitHub ignores the line.
#
# /api/       @backend-username
# /web/       @frontend-username
# /mobile/    @mobile-username
# /contract/  @backend-username @frontend-username @mobile-username
# /.github/   @release-lead-username
